---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="About Antons Blocked Drains North Beaches | Licensed Team" description="Meet the Antons team behind our Northern Beaches drainage service. Real job photography, NSW licence 210933C and clear explanations of drain clearing and repair." crumbs={[{name:'About',href:'/about'}]}>
  <section class="wrap page-hero"><div><h1>Capable hands.<br /><span class="blue">Clear explanations.</span></h1><p class="lead">Antons Blocked Drains North Beaches brings the Antons team’s drainage capability to homes, strata properties and businesses across the Northern Beaches.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>Call {site.phone}</a><a class="text-link" href="/our-work">See the team at work</a></div></div><Photo name="technician" alt="Antons technician beside a stocked plumbing service vehicle" eager /></section>
  <div class="wrap content-layout"><article class="reading"><section><h2>Drainage expertise you can see.</h2><p>Our work includes investigating blocked drains with CCTV, clearing suitable obstructions with professional jetting and mechanical equipment, and explaining repairs where damaged pipework is found. The photographs on this site show the team, root removal, camera work, exposed pipe connections and completed access points.</p><p>Experience matters when deciding how to enter a drain, what equipment the pipe can tolerate and whether cleaning is enough. We focus on those decisions and explain what the findings mean for your property.</p></section><section><h2>The same Antons team. A focused drain service.</h2><p>This is the Northern Beaches drainage service from the Antons team, working under NSW contractor licence {site.licence}. From the first call to the agreed repair, we aim to make the findings and your options clear.</p><p>We operate as a mobile service, planning each visit around the property, access and urgency. Check your suburb for practical booking information and call to confirm the available response.</p></section><section><h2>What a good service conversation includes.</h2><ul><li>Listening to the symptoms and asking about previous blockages.</li><li>Planning safe access to the affected drainage.</li><li>Explaining the initial work and any limitations of the inspection.</li><li>Discussing extra repair work before it proceeds.</li><li>Checking drainage and describing any remaining defect.</li></ul></section><section><h2>Verify the licence.</h2><p>Our NSW contractor licence number is <strong>{site.licence}</strong>. You can search that number using <a href="https://verify.licence.nsw.gov.au/home/Trades">Service NSW’s trades licence verification</a> for the current register record.</p></section></article><aside class="aside"><h2>Let’s talk about your drain.</h2><p>Tell us your suburb, what is affected and whether it is urgent. We confirm availability during booking.</p><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>{site.phone}</a><a href="/services">Drain services</a><a href="/service-areas">Northern Beaches coverage</a><a href="/contact">Booking information</a></aside></div><Cta />
</Layout>
